<view class="page"><view class="card"><text class="title">历史开奖</text><view class="muted">只显示万、千、百、十位；最新记录在前。</view><view class="row" style="margin-top:16rpx"><text>已保存 {{count}} 期</text><text>最后 {{latest}}</text></view></view><view class="card"><text class="title">手动补录</text><view class="muted">仅在核实真实开奖后补录。手动记录仅保存在本设备。</view><input type="number" maxlength="4" value="{{code}}" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="输入前四位，如 0123" style="background:#1d3550;padding:20rpx;margin:18rpx 0;border-radius:10rpx"/><button class="btn" bindtap="append">核实后追加</button></view><view class="card"><text class="title">最近100期</text><scroll-view scroll-y style="height:700rpx;margin-top:20rpx"><view class="row" wx:for="{{recent}}" wx:key="index" style="padding:15rpx;border-bottom:1rpx solid #25415e"><text class="muted">倒数第{{index+1}}期</text><text class="number">{{item}}</text></view></scroll-view></view></view>